  m_Name: RemainStanding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  paragraphs:
  - paragraph: the creature's grin fades slightly, replaced by a look of calculated
      irritation. "Ah, still standing, are you?" it says, its voice dripping with
      disdain. "Very well. If you refuse to engage, then perhaps you lack the wisdom
      to discern the value of my offer."
    action:
