        time: 0
  - paragraph: 'With a flick of its tail, the creature gestures toward the bag of
      treasures. "But know this: dangers lie ahead, and my aid could have been your
      safeguard. You may regret your stubbornness when you find yourself in dire
      straits."'
    action:
